1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:01,233
Ma una centrale

2
00:00:01,233 --> 00:00:02,321
nucleare può esplodere

3
00:00:02,321 --> 00:00:03,061
come una bomba

4
00:00:03,061 --> 00:00:03,840
atomica?

5
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:05,020
No

6
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:06,194
E non perché qualcuno

7
00:00:06,194 --> 00:00:07,150
la tiene a bada

8
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:08,800
lo impedisce la fisica

9
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,140
In una bomba

10
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:12,250
l'uranio 235

11
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:13,360
è quasi puro

12
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:14,846
più di 90 nuclei

13
00:00:14,846 --> 00:00:15,660
su 100

14
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:16,820
Ogni neutrone

15
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:18,500
anche se velocissimo

16
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:19,332
trova subito

17
00:00:19,332 --> 00:00:20,610
un nucleo da spaccare

18
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:21,292
e in meno

19
00:00:21,292 --> 00:00:22,279
di un milionesimo

20
00:00:22,279 --> 00:00:22,920
di secondo

21
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:23,512
si libera

22
00:00:23,512 --> 00:00:24,700
tutta l'energia

23
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:25,774
Per una centrale

24
00:00:25,774 --> 00:00:26,580
nucleare

25
00:00:26,670 --> 00:00:27,506
è completamente

26
00:00:27,506 --> 00:00:28,270
diverso

27
00:00:28,470 --> 00:00:29,738
Nella pastiglia

28
00:00:29,738 --> 00:00:31,005
di una centrale

29
00:00:31,005 --> 00:00:31,709
infatti

30
00:00:31,709 --> 00:00:32,766
l'uranio 235

31
00:00:32,766 --> 00:00:34,033
è solo da 3 a 5

32
00:00:34,033 --> 00:00:35,460
nuclei su 100

33
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:36,820
Tutti gli altri

34
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:38,280
sono uranio 238

35
00:00:38,570 --> 00:00:39,380
e molti neutroni

36
00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:40,320
finiscono lì

37
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:41,410
assorbiti

38
00:00:41,670 --> 00:00:42,598
Per andare avanti

39
00:00:42,598 --> 00:00:43,247
la reazione

40
00:00:43,247 --> 00:00:44,660
ha bisogno dell'acqua

41
00:00:44,790 --> 00:00:45,288
che rallenta

42
00:00:45,288 --> 00:00:46,020
i neutroni

43
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:47,206
E i neutroni

44
00:00:47,206 --> 00:00:48,510
più sono lenti

45
00:00:48,590 --> 00:00:49,594
più probabilità

46
00:00:49,594 --> 00:00:50,821
hanno di interagire

47
00:00:50,821 --> 00:00:52,180
con l'uranio 235

48
00:00:52,230 --> 00:00:53,290
E se il nocciolo

49
00:00:53,290 --> 00:00:54,351
si scalda troppo

50
00:00:54,351 --> 00:00:55,467
l'acqua si dilata

51
00:00:55,467 --> 00:00:56,304
e frena meno

52
00:00:56,304 --> 00:00:57,330
i neutroni

53
00:00:57,730 --> 00:00:58,430
la reazione

54
00:00:58,430 --> 00:00:59,680
rallenta da sola

55
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:00,791
Un incidente

56
00:01:00,791 --> 00:01:02,126
è molto improbabile

57
00:01:02,126 --> 00:01:03,580
ma può succedere

58
00:01:03,650 --> 00:01:04,684
ma un'esplosione

59
00:01:04,684 --> 00:01:05,228
atomica

60
00:01:05,228 --> 00:01:06,098
è fisicamente

61
00:01:06,098 --> 00:01:07,160
impossibile

62
00:01:07,360 --> 00:01:08,540
Hai qualche domanda?

63
00:01:08,740 --> 00:01:10,020
Fammela nei commenti!

